# UI Guardrails

Full contract: `docs/UI-GUARDRAILS.md`.

Do not change these in feature work (Interactions, Tournaments, Dashboard, data-model):

- Recruit card desktop split: identity left, Academic Interests + Schools of Interest upper-right
- Adaptive Workspace field grids: `WorkspaceFieldGrid` + `[data-aw-field-grid]` in `globals.css`
- Directory Search / Views row
- Recruiting nested nav geometry

Shared shell owns geometry. Feature modules own content only.

## RECRUIT CARD UI — LOCKED

- Recruit summary placement is protected.
- Academic Interests placement is protected.
- Schools of Interest remains on the right.
- Desktop AWs use the canonical compact multi-column grid (`WorkspaceFieldGrid` + `[data-aw-field-grid]`).
- Do not modify these layouts during unrelated feature work.
- Layout changes require an explicit user request.
